            <div style="padding:1.1rem 1.4rem; color:var(--stone); font-size:0.98rem; border-right:1px solid var(--line);">Spot and stain removal focus</div>
            <div style="padding:1.1rem 1.4rem; color:var(--charcoal); font-size:0.98rem; font-weight:500;">Sleep-surface hygiene and allergen reservoir reduction</div>
          </div>
