          <details style="background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden;">
            <summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:1.2rem 1.4rem; font-weight:600; font-size:1.02rem; position:relative; color:var(--charcoal);">
              What is the difference between mattress cleaning and mattress sanitation?
              <span style="position:absolute; right:1.3rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:var(--gold-dark); font-size:1.3rem;">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div style="padding: 0 1.4rem 1.3rem; color:var(--stone); font-size:0.98rem; line-height:1.6;">
              <strong>Cleaning</strong> is typically a surface-level extraction process borrowed from carpet workflows. It focuses on visible stains and uses high water volume. <strong>Sanitation</strong> is a disciplined protocol that treats the mattress as a sleep environment. It uses controlled dry vapor steam, low-moisture discipline, and attention to seams and allergen reservoirs. If you are investing in the surface you spend eight hours a night on, sanitation is the standard you actually want.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details style="background:var(--white); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden;">
            <summary style="list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:1.2rem 1.4rem; font-weight:600; font-size:1.02rem; position:relative; color:var(--charcoal);">
              How long will my mattress take to dry after service?
              <span style="position:absolute; right:1.3rem; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:var(--gold-dark); font-size:1.3rem;">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div style="padding: 0 1.4rem 1.3rem; color:var(--stone); font-size:0.98rem; line-height:1.6;">
